---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/ProjectNav.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="BraCovoit, Laije Belthassar BALONG"
  description="Simulation d'entreprise : cahier des charges, 2 processus BPMN, 18 user stories et un backlog en 2 sprints pour un covoiturage entre quartiers de Brazzaville."
  active="projets"
>

<p style="margin: 40px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5B6160"><a href="/projets" class="lnk">Projets</a><span aria-hidden="true" style="margin: 0 10px">/</span>BraCovoit</p>

<section style="padding: 32px 0 56px">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Cahier des charges</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Modélisation BPMN</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">User stories</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">Mobilité urbaine</span>
</p>
<h1 style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.03em">BraCovoit</h1>
<p style="margin: 24px 0 0; max-width: 60ch; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A504E">Un covoiturage entre quartiers de Brazzaville : un conducteur qui va dans la même direction, un prix connu avant de partir. J'ai traduit la discovery de l'équipe en cahier des charges, en processus et en backlog prêt pour le développement.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 40px 0 0; padding: 0">
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="1.8" fill="#E2ECE5"></rect><path d="M4 10h16M9 3v4M15 3v4"></path><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="3" height="3" rx=".7" fill="#3F6B57" stroke="none"></rect></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Date</span><span style="display: block; font-weight: 500">Juillet 2026</span></span>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="2.6" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><circle cx="5.5" cy="10" r="2" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="10" r="2" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><path d="M2.5 18.5c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3M21.5 18.5c0-1.7-1.3-3-3-3"></path><path d="M8 19.5c0-2.2 1.8-4 4-4s4 1.8 4 4" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Contexte</span><span style="display: block; font-weight: 500">Simulation d'entreprise, Akieni Academy</span></span>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9.5" cy="8" r="3" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><path d="M3.5 19.5c0-3.3 2.7-5.5 6-5.5 1.3 0 2.5.3 3.5.9"></path><path d="M16 20.5v-7h4.5l-1.2 1.75 1.2 1.75H16" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Rôle</span><span style="display: block; font-weight: 500">Business Analyst, binôme BA de l'équipe Cypher</span></span>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 13px; background: #FBFBF9; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13.5v5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18.5v-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 6h5" fill="#E2ECE5"></path><path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4l-8.5 8.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg></span>
<span><span style="display: block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">Site de l'équipe</span><a href="https://loriontsiba-debug.github.io/s8-Cypher-CypherRide/" style="display: block; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Voir BraCovoit en ligne</a></span>
</li>
</ul>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 32px">
<a href="#livrables" class="btn btn-main" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px">Voir les livrables</a>
<a href="#processus" class="btn btn-line" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; color: #17191A; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px">Voir les processus</a>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-label="Chiffres clés" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 88px">
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">13</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">exigences fonctionnelles, toutes en Must</p></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">9</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">règles de gestion au format SI, ALORS</p></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">2</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">processus BPMN, conducteur et passager</p></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1"><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1">18</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">user stories avec critères d'acceptation</p></div>
</section>

<section style="padding-bottom: 88px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Le besoin</h2>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 32px; max-width: 64ch; color: #4A504E">Pour aller d'un quartier à l'autre, les habitants combinent des transports informels, au coût et à l'attente imprévisibles. Des groupes WhatsApp organisent déjà du covoiturage, sans structure ni garantie. L'enjeu : structurer une pratique qui existe.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
<article style="padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="7.5" r="3" fill="#E2ECE5"></circle><path d="M3.5 19.5c0-3.3 2.5-5.5 5.5-5.5 1.5 0 2.8.5 3.8 1.4"></path><path d="M17.5 21s-3.5-3.2-3.5-6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 0c0 2.8-3.5 6-3.5 6z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#3F6B57"></path><path d="M17.5 15h.01" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="2"></path></svg><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px">Côté passager</span></p>
<ul style="margin: 18px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px">
<li style="padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC"><span style="color: #5B6160">Aujourd'hui :</span> il ne sait pas combien il va payer, et doit négocier.<br /><span style="color: #3F6B57; font-weight: 500">Réponse :</span> un prix connu d'avance, non négociable.</li>
<li><span style="color: #5B6160">Aujourd'hui :</span> il ne sait pas combien de temps il va attendre.<br /><span style="color: #3F6B57; font-weight: 500">Réponse :</span> une heure de départ connue, un trajet fiable.</li>
</ul>
</article>
<article style="padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3.5 12.5L5.6 7.8A2 2 0 0 1 7.4 6.6h9.2a2 2 0 0 1 1.8 1.2l2.1 4.7V16.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-15a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z" fill="#E2ECE5"></path><path d="M5.5 12.5h13" stroke="#3F6B57"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="17.5" r="1.9" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="17.5" r="1.9" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle></svg><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px">Côté conducteur</span></p>
<ul style="margin: 18px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px">
<li style="padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC"><span style="color: #5B6160">Aujourd'hui :</span> aucun moyen simple de trouver des passagers sur son itinéraire.<br /><span style="color: #3F6B57; font-weight: 500">Réponse :</span> publier son offre et laisser la plateforme faire le rapprochement.</li>
<li><span style="color: #5B6160">Aujourd'hui :</span> il roule avec des places vides et paie seul son carburant.<br /><span style="color: #3F6B57; font-weight: 500">Réponse :</span> remplir son véhicule et partager ses frais.</li>
</ul>
</article>
</div>
<p style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">Point de départ : la discovery du Product Manager et les personas du Digital Marketer de l'équipe, qui ne sont pas publiés ici.</p>
</section>

<section style="padding-bottom: 88px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Le périmètre du MVP</h2>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 32px; max-width: 64ch; color: #4A504E">Un parcours complet de bout en bout, et des renoncements écrits noir sur blanc pour tenir le délai.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px">
<div style="flex: 3 1 420px; min-width: 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">Dans le périmètre</p>
<ul style="margin: 14px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 10px 24px; font-size: 15px">
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#3F6B57"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 10" stroke="#FFFFFF"></path></svg>Consultation libre, compte pour réserver ou publier</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#3F6B57"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 10" stroke="#FFFFFF"></path></svg>Inscription du conducteur avec CNI, permis et véhicule</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#3F6B57"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 10" stroke="#FFFFFF"></path></svg>Publication d'une offre, prix calculé selon la distance</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#3F6B57"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 10" stroke="#FFFFFF"></path></svg>Recherche et rapprochement des offres</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#3F6B57"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 10" stroke="#FFFFFF"></path></svg>Réservation validée par le conducteur, paiement en espèces</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#3F6B57"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 10" stroke="#FFFFFF"></path></svg>Notation du conducteur après le trajet</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="flex: 2 1 280px; min-width: 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F1F4F2">
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">Hors périmètre</p>
<ul style="margin: 14px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="#9AA09D" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></circle></svg>Paiement mobile intégré</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="#9AA09D" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></circle></svg>GPS et suivi en temps réel</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="#9AA09D" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></circle></svg>Messagerie entre utilisateurs</li>
<li style="display: flex; gap: 10px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="#9AA09D" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></circle></svg>Historique, notifications, annulations</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px; padding-bottom: 88px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 240px; min-width: 0">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Mon rôle</h2>
<p style="margin: 12px 0 0; color: #4A504E">L'un des deux Business Analysts de l'équipe, j'ai rédigé le cahier des charges et ses processus BPMN, puis contribué au FRD, aux user stories et au backlog. Extrait de la matrice RACI du cahier des charges.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 520px; min-width: 0; padding: 24px; border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1; overflow-x: auto">
<table style="width: 100%; min-width: 520px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; text-align: center">
<caption style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0)">Extrait de la matrice RACI : R réalise, A approuve, C consulté, I informé</caption>
<thead>
<tr style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">
<th scope="col" style="text-align: left; font-weight: 400; padding: 8px 12px 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1">Livrable</th>
<th scope="col" style="font-weight: 400; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1">PM</th>
<th scope="col" style="font-weight: 500; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1; color: #3F6B57">BA</th>
<th scope="col" style="font-weight: 400; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1">Dév.</th>
<th scope="col" style="font-weight: 400; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E1">CP</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; font-weight: 400; padding: 12px 12px 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC">Cahier des charges, FRD, BPMN</th><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC; color: #5B6160">C</td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC"><span style="padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px">A / R</span></td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC; color: #5B6160">I</td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC; color: #5B6160">C</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; font-weight: 400; padding: 12px 12px 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC">User stories et critères d'acceptation</th><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC; color: #5B6160">C</td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC"><span style="padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px">A / R</span></td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC; color: #5B6160">C</td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEF0EC; color: #5B6160">C</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; font-weight: 400; padding: 12px 12px 12px 0">Backlog priorisé de la V1</th><td style="padding: 12px 8px; color: #5B6160">A</td><td style="padding: 12px 8px"><span style="padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px">R</span></td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; color: #5B6160">I</td><td style="padding: 12px 8px; color: #5B6160">C</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">R : réalise. A : approuve. C : consulté. I : informé. Dév. : développeur fullstack. CP : chef de projet, senior dev.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="processus" style="padding-bottom: 88px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Deux processus modélisés</h2>
<p style="margin: 8px 0 24px; max-width: 64ch; color: #4A504E">Chaque étape porte son acteur entre crochets, comme dans le cahier des charges. Les embranchements montrent ce qui arrête le parcours.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444">Conducteur</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F3EAE5; color: #6E4532">Passager</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E">Système</span>
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 12px; color: #4A504E"><span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 10px; height: 10px; transform: rotate(45deg); border: 1.5px solid #3F6B57; background: #FFFFFF"></span>Décision</span>
</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start">

<figure style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<figcaption style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 19px">1. Publier une offre</figcaption>
<p style="margin: 4px 0 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #5B6160">Parcours du conducteur</p>
<ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
